---
layout: layout.njk
title: Blog - Calculator Guides and Tutorials
description: Practical guides on tipping, macros, compound interest, UUIDs, GPA, fractions and more. Written to explain the maths behind our free tools.
permalink: "/blog/"
appName: Blog
---

<h1>QuixCalc Blog</h1>
<p>Read our latest articles and tutorials.</p>

<div class="card-grid" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
  {% if collections.blog.length == 0 %}
    <p><em>No blog posts published yet. Check back soon!</em></p>
  {% else %}
    {% for post in collections.blog | reverse %}
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="tool-card blog-card">
            <div class="card-header" style="background-color: var(--input-bg);">
                <span class="card-icon">📝</span>
                <h3 style="color: var(--text-main);">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1;">
                <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; flex-grow: 1;">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
                <span class="btn" style="width:100%; border-radius:6px; font-weight:600;">Read Full Guide</span>
            </div>
        </a>
    {% endfor %}
  {% endif %}
</div>
